# ===========================
[Ll]ibrary/
[Tt]emp/
[Oo]bj/
[Bb]uild/
[Bb]uilds/
[Ll]ogs/
MemoryCaptures/
UserSettings/
sysinfo.txt
*.stackdump

# Unity asset database cache
*.pidb

# Partial/meta temp
*.meta.tmp

