# PROJECT FILES (IDE)
# ===========================
# Visual Studio / MonoDevelop / Rider
*.sln
*.csproj
*.unityproj
*.user
*.userprefs
*.suo
*.booproj
*.svd
.vs/
.idea/

# VSCode
.vscode/

